  "hill_country_ruling": {
   "classification": "The metro-continuous Lake Travis SOUTH shore (Lakeway / Bee Cave / Hudson Bend / Steiner Ranch, 78734 / 78738 / 78732) is a STRONG CORRIDOR; Dripping Springs and the US-290 Belterra corridor (78620 / 78737) are FRINGE; the destination Hill Country is OUTSIDE.",
