   "drive_market_relationship": "Lakeway / Bee Cave / Dripping Springs are commuter suburbs whose visitors are Austin-bound; Fredericksburg, Wimberley, Johnson City and Marble Falls are destinations a traveller drives TO.",
   "traveller_intent": "Wine country, river tubing, lake houses and ranch resorts are Hill Country intent; the Galleria, Lakeway's marina hotels and the US-290 venues sit inside Austin's suburban band.",
   "metro_continuity": "Continuous suburban development runs from Oak Hill to Dripping Springs on US-290 and from West Lake Hills to Lakeway on SH-71 / RM-620; it stops at Spicewood, Driftwood and Lago Vista.",
